{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling Control Action that Starts with a Catch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat begins with a single catch.<br>Control your flight device to precisely catch characters falling from the sky\u2014only then does the battle begin.<br>With enemies and projectiles coming from all directions, predict the falling path and move swiftly.<br>One precise control can change the flow of the entire battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/fc97f8840b6bfb0eec75a950d3d68c69.poster.avif?t=1769133444\" width=1600 height=892 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/fc97f8840b6bfb0eec75a950d3d68c69.webm?t=1769133444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/fc97f8840b6bfb0eec75a950d3d68c69.mp4?t=1769133444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Distinct Characters, Strategic Team Combinations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a unique attack style and skill.<br>Some gather enemies to eliminate them at once, some control the battlefield with powerful knockbacks, and others strengthen the team with support abilities.<br>Your combat experience changes dramatically depending on your choice of characters.<br>Design your own combinations and create a unique playstyle by linking skills together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/7fe533aa246a5774516f8edf9a840d3d.poster.avif?t=1769133444\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/7fe533aa246a5774516f8edf9a840d3d.webm?t=1769133444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/7fe533aa246a5774516f8edf9a840d3d.mp4?t=1769133444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills That Evolve Through Build Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your upgrades, attack patterns can change, skill effects evolve, and your entire playstyle can shift.<br>This is more than just number scaling\u2014it\u2019s about evolving your combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the joy of growth where skills transform and strategies expand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/b0046f2ee4f8ca91a78a0e844bafd864.poster.avif?t=1769133444\" width=1600 height=892 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/b0046f2ee4f8ca91a78a0e844bafd864.webm?t=1769133444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/b0046f2ee4f8ca91a78a0e844bafd864.mp4?t=1769133444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3818230/45696f3e56c9159e58e48c5287cd03c62359a5dd.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Aegis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3818230/4e2a65f97f68941ba1280ccae0f9c47715ff516e.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Hermes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3818230/2d65de7f6aa07140323ff6c3ba456ccfabe7d563.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Onmyoji","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/app